    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691470/extras/cba4309637f71c7696c3858d5b043c0d.avif?t=1742846166\" width=622 height=350 /></span>Meet Paul and his fianc\u00e9e, Lisa! They have exciting plans for the big day, but things take a turn for the worst. First, there is a suspicious accident in which one of their friends is killed. Then, a Scotland Yard officer recruits Paul as an undercover agent\u2026 They become involved in an investigation that will change their relationship forever. I guess many things can go wrong on the road to marriage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is certain is that their lives will never be the same...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691470/extras/bf0f5d9cb3cecf110bc19a12445af559.avif?t=1742846166\" width=622 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this virtual novel, you play the role of the future groom. You will have multiple choices that have impacts on your relation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knowing your fianc\u00e9e decided to go off the pill to show her pregnancy to everyone at the wedding, will you still share your girlfriend with your best friend and/or try to keep her away from your perverted customer? This is your choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691470/extras/5d0762030974d82e6f8aef6dafc057da.poster.avif?t=1742846166\" width=622 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691470/extras/5d0762030974d82e6f8aef6dafc057da.webm?t=1742846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691470/extras/5d0762030974d82e6f8aef6dafc057da.mp4?t=1742846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lisa will also encounter strange fetishes like pet play and forniphilia (objectifying people).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How deep will the rabbit hole go\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their wedding ceremony will surely be unlike any other before! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691470/extras/168459a78c53d8adff1dfaa77da37893.avif?t=1742846166\" width=622 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >At the moment : </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part One is finished! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there are about 9 hours of content and lots of H scene!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more than 90,000 words</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3200 static renders</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >88 smoothed animations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >57 music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part Two is underway and already contain: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >about 1 hour and 40 minutes of content!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more than 55,000 words</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1,229 static renders</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >37 smoothed animations</p></li></ul>",
